{"questions":[{"question_id":"1lfme0v94","paperTitle":"IIT-JEE 2009 Paper 1 Offline","year":2009,"examDate":2009,"subject":"physics","chapter":"electrostatics","chapterGroup":"electricity","topic":"electric-flux-and-gauss-law","type":"mcq","marks":3,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"pthree-concentric-metallic-spherical-shells-of-radii-r2-jee-advanced-physics-motion-lml5wehflmzzc8o4","content":"<p>Three concentric metallic spherical shells of radii <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.426ex\" height=\"1.984ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 4166.3 877\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(759,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1203.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1703.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2462.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2907.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3407.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are given charges <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.344ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 4572 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1227.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1672.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2899.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3344.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, respectively. It is found that the surface charge densities on the outer surfaces of the shells are equal. Then, the ratio of the charges given to the shells, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.104ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 5349.8 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1505.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2061.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3566.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"3A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(4122.2,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, is</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"1 : 2 : 3"},{"identifier":"B","content":"1 : 3 : 5"},{"identifier":"C","content":"1 : 4 : 9"},{"identifier":"D","content":"1 : 8 : 18"}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"<p>Surface charge density is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.887ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.811ex\" height=\"3.093ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -975 3894.7 1367.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D70C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(794.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1850.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(742.4,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(220,-377.4) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D70B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1073,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D445\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D445\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(792,289) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g><rect width=\"1804.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where R is the radius of the sphere. For cancelling the field inside the cavity due to the shell of radius R, the shell with radius 2R induces a charge <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>Q in its inner surface and hence the total charge on the outer surface is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.32ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 3677.6 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1449.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2450,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. Similarly, the charge on the outermost shell is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.863ex\" height=\"2.032ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -704 6127.5 898\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1449.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2450,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D444\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D444\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(824,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3899.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4900,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g d